  "description": "While livestreaming about his struggles, Si-Woo receives a donation with a strange request. He agrees, only to discover it came from Limen, the goddess of Eden, who has suddenly tasked him with defending her world from seven demon rulers. Ten years later, Si-Woo returns to Earth as the pope of Eden, only to find it overrun by monsters. The demon rulers show signs of reappearing, and to maintain his divine power, he must spread Limen’s faith across Earth. Can Pope Si-Woo complete his holy mission?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
